              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a professional lead qualification assistant for a business. Always respond ONLY with valid JSON, no extra text, no markdown formatting."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Lead details:\n    Name: {{ $json.name }}\n    Email: {{ $json.email }}\n    Message: {{ $json.message }}\n\n    Task:\n    1. Classify this lead using these exact rules:\n   - \"Hot\": the lead expresses urgency (words like \"urgent,\" \"today,\" \"ASAP,\" \"losing money\"), a clear budget, or explicit intent to buy/start soon.\n   - \"Warm\": the lead shows genuine interest or asks relevant questions, but with no urgency or timeline mentioned.\n   - \"Cold\": the lead is vague, dismissive, uninterested, or explicitly asks to be left alone/unsubscribed..\n    2. Give a one-sentence reason for the classification.\n    3. Write a short, friendly, personalized reply to send this lead.\n\n    Respond in exactly this JSON structure:\n    {\"classification\": \"Hot\", \"reason\": \"...\", \"reply\": \"...\"}"
            }
          ]
        },
